General_SiSo_Auto_EnergySaving_RMOD_Deep_Sleep_Responsiveness
    [Documentation]
    ...  The purpose of this test case is to collect all timestamps described in:
    ...  - for deep sleep CNI-137769 OM_GEN_SFS_PERF_CAP.33882 RU deep sleep mode responsiveness
    ...  - for extreme deep sleep OM_GEN_SFS_PERF_CAP.33884 RU extreme deep sleep mode responsiveness
    ...  and verify whether the rmod(s) and cell(s) configured in the power saving group(s) switch their energy saving mode within the KPI limits.
    ...  Warning: Before running this TC ensure that:
    ...  IF ${power_saving_group_distns}==${None} at least one power saving group should be created on BTS.
    ...  IF ${power_saving_group_distns}!=${None} provided power saving group dist name(s) should exist on the BTS.
    ...  SCF parameters recommissioned by test to activate feature:
    ...  - LTE:
    ...      actMixedSOMethod=true
    ...      actLBPowerSaving=true
    ...      actLBRTXPowerSaving=true
    ...      lbpsSOMethod=Mixed Switch Off
    ...  - NR:
    ...      actNrMixedSOMethod=true
    ...      actNrLBPowerSaving=true
    ...      actNrLBmMimoRTXPowerSaving/actNrLBRTXPowerSaving=true (depending on RMOD type, mMIMO or not)
    ...      lbpsSOMethod=mixed switch off
    ...  - RMOD:
    ...      energySavingMode=DEEPSLEEP/DEEPSLEEP_EXTREME_SFP
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  ${power_saving_duration} (str):            Duration of the power saving period in minutes. Default is 10 minutes.
    ...  ${power_saving_group_distns} (str | list): List of power saving group dist names to be used in the test. Default is ${None}.
    ...                                             e.g. ['MRBTS-50589/NRBTS-50589/NRPGRP-1', 'MRBTS-50589/NRBTS-50589/NRPGRP-2'].
    ...                                             If not provided, the test will use all configured power groups on BTS.
    ...  ${deep_sleep_mode} (str):                  Type of deep sleep mode to be tested. Possible values are 'DEEPSLEEP' and 'DEEPSLEEP_EXTREME_SFP'.
    ...                                             Default is 'DEEPSLEEP'.

    [Arguments]      ${power_saving_duration}=10
    ...              ${power_saving_group_distns}=${None}
    ...              ${deep_sleep_mode}=DEEPSLEEP
    [Timeout]        24 hours

    ${bts_type}=                                            hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}=                                          connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    Set test variable                                       ${connection}
    Set test variable                                       ${bts_type}
    config_operations.connect                               alias=${connection}

    Verify BTS And VM Time Match                            bts_type=${bts_type}

    IF  not $power_saving_group_distns
        ${power_saving_group_distns}=                       admin_info_model.get_power_saving_group_distnames
        ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    END

    ${power_saving_group_distns}=                           utilities.convert_to_list    ${power_saving_group_distns}

    ${mapped_rmod_to_cells}                                 Map RMOD To Cells From Power Saving Groups
    ...                                                     power_saving_groups=${power_saving_group_distns}

    ${start_save_period}  ${end_save_period}                Activate RMOD Deep Sleep Energy Saving And Wait Till End
    ...                                                     power_saving_groups=${power_saving_group_distns}
    ...                                                     mapped_rmod_to_cells=${mapped_rmod_to_cells}
    ...                                                     power_saving_duration=${power_saving_duration}
    ...                                                     deep_sleep_mode=${deep_sleep_mode}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Collecting responsiveness timestamps from syslog ...

    ${rmod_timestamps}=                                     btslog_parser.get_deep_sleep_energy_saving_responsiveness_timestamps
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     mapped_rmod_to_cells=${mapped_rmod_to_cells}
    ...                                                     start_time=${start_save_period}
    ...                                                     end_time=${end_save_period}
    ...                                                     deep_sleep_mode=${deep_sleep_mode}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Timestamps successfully collected.

#    THIS PART IS TEMPORARILY DISABLED DUE TO KPI TARGETS NOT YET BEING DEFINED
#    btslog_verifiers.verify_deep_sleep_responsiveness_kpi   rmod_timestamps=${rmod_timestamps.copy()}

    Create Timestamps Results Message                       timestamps=${rmod_timestamps}

    [Teardown]                                              Deep Sleep Responsiveness Teardown


Activate RMOD Deep Sleep Energy Saving And Wait Till End
    [Documentation]  This keyword activates deep sleep/extreme deep sleep energy saving period and waits till the end.
    [Arguments]      ${power_saving_groups}
    ...              ${mapped_rmod_to_cells}
    ...              ${power_saving_duration}
    ...              ${deep_sleep_mode}

    ${energy_saving_cell_conf_distns}=                      Evaluate  [cell for cells in $mapped_rmod_to_cells.values() for cell in cells]
    ${energy_saving_rmod_conf_ids}=                         Evaluate  [rmod.split('-')[-1] for rmod in $mapped_rmod_to_cells.keys()]

    ${start_save_period}    ${end_save_period}=             Calculate Start And End Time Of Power Saving Period
    ...                                                     duration=${power_saving_duration}
    ...                                                     start_time_offset=5

    config_operations.activate_deep_sleep_energy_saving_period
    ...                                                     start_save_period=${start_save_period}
    ...                                                     duration=${power_saving_duration}
    ...                                                     power_saving_groups=${power_saving_groups}
    ...                                                     deep_sleep_type=${deep_sleep_mode}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Power saving period 'ACTIVATED'.

    ${cells_remained_online}=                               Run Keyword And Return Status
    ...                                                     Poll Keyword Until Timeout Or Failure
    ...                                                     ${start_save_period}    5s
    ...                                                     status_check.verify_cell_statuses
    ...                                                     ${connection}
    ...                                                     online
    ...                                                     cells_distnames=${energy_saving_cell_conf_distns}

    IF  not ${cells_remained_online}
        Robot Log Operation                                 Detected cells reset after activating energy saving period. Waiting for cells to come back online ...
        Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                         10min    5sec
        ...                                                 status_check.verify_cell_statuses
        ...                                                 connection=${connection}
        ...                                                 status_variant=online
        ...                                                 cells_distnames=${energy_saving_cell_conf_distns}
        Robot Log Operation                                 Cells have successfully returned online.
        ${start_save_period}    ${end_save_period}=         Calculate Start And End Time Of Power Saving Period
        ...                                                 duration=${power_saving_duration}
        ...                                                 start_time_offset=2
        Set Power Saving Group Period List                  power_group_distns=${power_saving_groups}
        ...                                                 start_save_period=${start_save_period}
        ...                                                 duration=${power_saving_duration}
        Sleep                                               10s
    END

    Robot Log Operation                                     Power saving period starts at: ${start_save_period}, ends at: ${end_save_period}.

    Poll Keyword Until Timeout Or Failure                   ${start_save_period}    5s
    ...                                                     status_check.verify_cell_statuses
    ...                                                     ${connection}
    ...                                                     online
    ...                                                     cells_distnames=${energy_saving_cell_conf_distns}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Power saving period is now active. Waiting for cells to enter 'reducedEnergySaving' state ...

    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             10min    5sec
    ...                                                     status_check.verify_cell_statuses
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     status_variant=reduced_energy_saving
    ...                                                     cells_distnames=${energy_saving_cell_conf_distns}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Cells transitioned to 'reducedEnergySaving'. Waiting for 'energySaving' state ...

    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             10min    5sec
    ...                                                     status_check.verify_cell_statuses
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     status_variant=energy_saving
    ...                                                     cells_distnames=${energy_saving_cell_conf_distns}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Cells are now in 'energySaving' state. Waiting for RMODs to enter '${deep_sleep_mode}' ...

    ${deep_sleep_variant}=                                  Set Variable If  '${deep_sleep_mode}'=='DEEPSLEEP'
    ...                                                     deep_sleep
    ...                                                     extreme_deep_sleep

    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             10min    5sec
    ...                                                     status_check.verify_statuses_of_rmods
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     status_variant=${deep_sleep_variant}
    ...                                                     rmod_ids=${energy_saving_rmod_conf_ids}

    Robot Log Operation                                     RMODs are now in '${deep_sleep_mode}' state. Waiting for the power saving period to end ...

    Poll Keyword Until Timeout Or Failure                   ${end_save_period}    5s
    ...                                                     status_check.verify_statuses_of_rmods
    ...                                                     ${connection}
    ...                                                     ${deep_sleep_variant}
    ...                                                     rmod_ids=${energy_saving_rmod_conf_ids}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Power saving period ended. Waiting for cells to come back online ...

    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             10min    5sec
    ...                                                     status_check.verify_cell_statuses
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     status_variant=online
    ...                                                     cells_distnames=${energy_saving_cell_conf_distns}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Cells have successfully returned online.

    [Return]                                                ${start_save_period}    ${end_save_period}


Map RMOD To Cells From Power Saving Groups
    [Documentation]  This keyword maps cells to their corresponding RMODs based on the resources configured in power saving groups.
    [Arguments]      ${power_saving_groups}

    ${cells_to_rmods}=                                      Create Dictionary
    ${pg_cells}=                                            admin_info_model.get_cell_distnames_from_power_saving_groups
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     power_group_distnames=${power_saving_groups}

    FOR   ${cell_distn}                                     IN  @{pg_cells}
        @{rmod_conf_distns}=                                admin_info_model.get_rmod_distn_based_on_cell_distn
        ...                                                 connection=${connection}
        ...                                                 cell_distn=${cell_distn}

        FOR  ${rmod_conf_distns}                            IN  @{rmod_conf_distns}
            Evaluate                                        $cells_to_rmods.setdefault($rmod_conf_distns, []).append($cell_distn)
        END

    END

    [Return]                                                ${cells_to_rmods}


Deep Sleep Responsiveness Teardown
    [Documentation]  Teardown keyword to restore configuration after test execution.
    
    config_operations.restore_configuration
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds                             10min    5sec
    ...                                                     Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    
